5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to see where the money actually goes before we promise anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"We must confirm who is actually available to work, not just who is on paper.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The data on what people actually enjoy is more important than our pride.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building itself has limits that we often ignore until it is too late.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the logistics that always seem to fail us at the door.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, do you have specific roles in mind that are currently vacant?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, yes, the conservation and floor staff are critically understaffed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, what specific structural limits are you referring to?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the suspended bay has a strict weight limit we must respect.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, perhaps we should look at the transport costs first?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that sounds reasonable. I will check the transport and mounting costs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the structural survey and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the lender paperwork and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Agreed. Let's see what the numbers say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It is better to be prepared than to be surprised.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,The record will speak for itself.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Safety is non-negotiable.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us hope the paperwork is in order this time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
