35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are shocking. They are nearly a third of the installation budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The conservation lab is down to one person. The backlog is two hundred pieces.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,Head counts drop in static rooms. People come back for live demonstrations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The suspended bay can only hold four hundred kilos per square metre.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two recent openings slipped because the paperwork arrived after the cut-off.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that weight limit is a huge constraint for heavy loans.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, so live elements are key, but who will maintain them?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the comment slips say people want to see someone working.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, yes. And the maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs last season.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, if transport is so high, maybe we should avoid heavy loans?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that makes sense. Local items would save on transport and mounting.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, if we choose live elements, we need to ensure staff can handle it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the data supports interactive or demonstrative exhibits.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, local items might be lighter, which helps with the structural limits.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, the volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"So, local, light, and interactive seems to be the winning combination.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,We must ensure the town history circle can support the specific needs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"The evidence points to a show that is alive, not just displayed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,A local show fits the structural and maintenance constraints best.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,And it avoids the shipping delays that plagued us before.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
